The '''Ilum system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[7G sector]] of the [[Unknown Regions]] that contained the [[Water|ice]] [[planet]] [[Ilum]]<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> in its fifth position,<ref name="NoP" /> which was important in the training of [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Initiate|younglings]],<ref name="The Gathering" /> as well as an [[Unidentified planet (Ilum system)|airless planet]] furthest from the system's center.<ref name="Ahsoka" /> The system had one [[star]], a [[blue dwarf]] named [[Asar]] that was extremely bright for its star type. Located further out in the system was a [[Ilum system cometary cloud|cometary cloud]].<ref name="NoP" /> Ilum later moved into a neighboring system by the [[First Order]] during the construction of a [[superweapon]] known as [[Starkiller Base]] on the planet.<ref name="BattleStations">{{EncyclopediaCite|Battle Stations of the Empire and the First Order}}</ref>

